            "passageText": "Analyzing commercial real estate debt securitization & interest rate swaps requires evaluating systemic interactions between market demand, regulatory constraints, and technological innovation. Historical data reveals that firms adapting proactively to structural shifts achieve higher long-term capital returns than reactive competitors.",
            "questionText": "According to the passage, what primary advantage do proactive firms gain over reactive competitors?",
