            "passageText": "Analyzing renewable energy credit trading & carbon offset derivatives requires evaluating systemic interactions between market demand, regulatory constraints, and technological innovation. Historical data reveals that firms adapting proactively to structural shifts achieve higher long-term capital returns than reactive competitors.",
